From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:59:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: cs35l41: honour cirrus,dsp-no-hibernate

Once the DSP has run, runtime suspend sends it the CSPL hibernate
command and runtime resume wakes it with "out of hibernate", expecting
the paused status back. With the stock protection firmware on the Pixel
7 Pro (0x400a4 v0.45.0, driven over SPI with the PLL on the TDM bit
clock) neither works: the pause at stream stop is never acknowledged
("Failed to set mailbox cmd 1 (status 0)"), and at the next stream the
wake fails ("Wake failed, re-enter hibernate: -42", then "CSPL Error
Detected" and "Timed out waking device"), the PCM cannot be opened and
only a reset of the amplifier brings the DSP back.

When the firmware node has cirrus,dsp-no-hibernate, skip hibernation in
runtime suspend and the wake in runtime resume, so the DSP keeps running
between streams as the vendor driver does when hibernation is not
enabled. Runtime PM itself is unchanged.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
---
 include/sound/cs35l41.h    | 1 +
 sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.c | 8 ++++++--
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/sound/cs35l41.h b/include/sound/cs35l41.h
index 7542cabfa..3895f4e07 100644
--- a/include/sound/cs35l41.h
+++ b/include/sound/cs35l41.h
@@ -814,6 +814,7 @@ struct cs35l41_hw_cfg {
 	struct cs35l41_gpio_cfg gpio1;
 	struct cs35l41_gpio_cfg gpio2;
 	unsigned int spk_pos;
+	bool dsp_no_hibernate;
 
 	enum cs35l41_boost_type bst_type;
 };
diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.c b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.c
index b2a076706..ad55889c4 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.c
@@ -1032,6 +1032,8 @@ static int cs35l41_handle_pdata(struct device *dev, struct cs35l41_hw_cfg *hw_cf
 			hw_cfg->bst_type = val;
 	}
 
+	hw_cfg->dsp_no_hibernate = device_property_read_bool(dev, "cirrus,dsp-no-hibernate");
+
 	ret = device_property_read_u32(dev, "cirrus,boost-peak-milliamp", &val);
 	if (ret >= 0)
 		hw_cfg->bst_ipk = val;
@@ -1401,7 +1403,8 @@ static int cs35l41_runtime_suspend(struct device *dev)
 
 	dev_dbg(cs35l41->dev, "Runtime suspend\n");
 
-	if (!cs35l41->dsp.preloaded || !cs35l41->dsp.cs_dsp.running)
+	if (!cs35l41->dsp.preloaded || !cs35l41->dsp.cs_dsp.running ||
+	    cs35l41->hw_cfg.dsp_no_hibernate)
 		return 0;
 
 	wm_adsp_hibernate(&cs35l41->dsp, true);
@@ -1420,7 +1423,8 @@ static int cs35l41_runtime_resume(struct device *dev)
 
 	dev_dbg(cs35l41->dev, "Runtime resume\n");
 
-	if (!cs35l41->dsp.preloaded || !cs35l41->dsp.cs_dsp.running)
+	if (!cs35l41->dsp.preloaded || !cs35l41->dsp.cs_dsp.running ||
+	    cs35l41->hw_cfg.dsp_no_hibernate)
 		return 0;
 
 	regcache_cache_only(cs35l41->regmap, false);
